@startuml
title OfflineTransaction — reconciliation status
[*] --> AwaitingReconciliation : enter [new reference]
[*] --> ReferredToManager : enter [repeated reference] / DuplicateReference
AwaitingReconciliation --> Reconciled : reconcile [clean] / sale recorded
AwaitingReconciliation --> ReferredToManager : reconcile [duplicate or conflict] / reason
AwaitingReconciliation --> AwaitingReconciliation : reconcile [technical failure]
ReferredToManager --> Resolved : resolve(decision, note)
Reconciled --> [*]
Resolved --> [*]
@enduml